 * Declares the EnumSymbol class.
 *
 * EnumSymbol represents the semantic information associated with an enumeration
 * declaration(`EnumDecl`). It stores the syntactic declaration, the validated
 * generator, and the ordered list of enumeration fields with their associated
 * constant values.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
